em is to find which one is corrupted!\n\nEDIT: in 4.7.1 I get 140 error message and I don't need to stop the game to get these errors.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nNo idea. Seems to be related to material files being corrupted.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot possible at the moment.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119384/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}